  showTextOnMainPage: 1
  showNavigationButtons: 0
  pageText:
  - Jessie keeps asking me where Dusty went. What am I supposed to tell her? We already
    told her that he didn't want to move to the new house, and so he stayed behind,
    but now she's asking me to go back and get him. Am I supposed to tell her he's
    dead? How do I even begin to explain that to her? Do we just get a new dog and
    pretend? I don't know what to do about it, Oliver.
  mainTextAreaScale: {x: 500, y: 700}
  mainTextSize: 42
  - 'Jessie keeps asking me where Dusty went. What am I supposed to tell her? We
    already told her that he didn''t want to move to the new house, and so he stayed
    behind, but now she''s asking me to go back and get him. Am I supposed to tell
    her he''s dead? How do I even begin to explain that to her? Do we just get a
    new dog and pretend? I don''t know what to do about it, Oliver. '
